-#
-#  The other members of the person's family (FamilyMember), in the aside
-#  below the household and built like it (HouseholdAsideComponent): a section
-#  whenever there are any, for everyone who sees the person's details, the
-#  person included. A name links the other person only where the viewer may
-#  see them (Wsjrdp2027::PeopleHelper#wsjrdp_family_row). Whoever may edit the
-#  family (:update_family: the privileged view, the unit leaders) sees the
-#  section always, with the button to the family page
-#  (Person::FamilyMembersController).
-#
-#  Locals: person
- editable = can?(:update_family, person)
- if FeatureGate.enabled?("people.family_members") && (person.family_members.any? || editable)
  %section
    %h2
      Andere Familienmitglieder
      - if editable
        %span.float-end
          .btn-group
            = action_button(person.family_members.any? ? "Bearbeiten" : "Hinzufügen",
              edit_person_family_members_path(person), person.family_members.any? ? :edit : :plus)
    - if person.family_members.any?
      %table.table.table-basic
        = wsjrdp_render_family(person)
